{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1786834533, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "linux"}}
[0.078518, "o", "\u001b[1A\u001b[1B\u001b[0G\u001b[?25l[+] Creating 1/0\r\n \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m Container aluminadb-mysql  \u001b[32mRunning\u001b[0m                                      \u001b[34m0.0s \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25h"]
[0.489686, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[0.491059, "o", "  ALUMINADB -- SHIFT PLANNING\r\n"]
[0.492487, "o", "============================================================\r\n"]
[2.497717, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.499877, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.501413, "o", " Most urgent open orders\r\n"]
[2.503044, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.50477, "o", "pedidos_pendientes_v already nets each order against what's\r\n"]
[2.506496, "o", "been shipped so far -- highest priority first:\r\n"]
[4.509669, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    nro_pedido,\r\n    nro_subpedido,\r\n    codigo,\r\n    long__m,\r\n    cant_pendiente,\r\n    id_prioridad\r\nFROM pedidos_pendientes_v\r\nWHERE cant_pendiente > 0\r\nORDER BY id_prioridad DESC, nro_pedido\r\nLIMIT 10\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[4.512073, "o", "+------------+---------------+--------------+---------+----------------+--------------+\r\n| nro_pedido | nro_subpedido | codigo       | long__m | cant_pendiente | id_prioridad |\r\n+------------+---------------+--------------+---------+----------------+--------------+\r\n|         56 |             6 | PROFILE-0177 |   6.000 |            120 |            1 |\r\n|         56 |             7 | PROFILE-0175 |   6.000 |            119 |            1 |\r\n|         57 |             4 | PROFILE-0082 |   6.000 |             30 |            1 |\r\n|         59 |             1 | PROFILE-0082 |   6.000 |             49 |            1 |\r\n|         59 |             4 | PROFILE-0177 |   6.000 |             63 |            1 |\r\n|         59 |             5 | PROFILE-0175 |   6.000 |             80 |            1 |\r\n|         94 |             5 | PROFILE-0175 |   6.000 |             40 |            1 |\r\n|         94 |             8 | PROFILE-0082 |   6.000 |             19 |            1 |\r\n|         94 |            16 | PROFILE-0177 |   6.000 |             65 |            1 |\r\n|         94 |            17 | PROFILE-0175 |   6.000 |             49 |            1 |\r\n+------------+---------------+--------------+---------+----------------+--------------+\r\n10 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[7.51577, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.51694, "o", "Three profile codes account for all ten: PROFILE-0177,\r\n"]
[7.51815, "o", "PROFILE-0175, PROFILE-0082. Before extruding more, check\r\n"]
[7.51934, "o", "what's already sitting in stock for those exact codes:\r\n"]
[9.522183, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    cod_perfil,\r\n    long_perfil__m,\r\n    cantidad AS in_stock\r\nFROM stock_perfiles_nat_resumen_v\r\nWHERE cod_perfil IN ('PROFILE-0177', 'PROFILE-0175', 'PROFILE-0082')\r\nORDER BY cod_perfil, long_perfil__m\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[9.523251, "o", "+--------------+----------------+----------+\r\n| cod_perfil   | long_perfil__m | in_stock |\r\n+--------------+----------------+----------+\r\n| PROFILE-0082 |          5.000 |       41 |\r\n| PROFILE-0082 |          6.000 |      200 |\r\n| PROFILE-0175 |          5.000 |       54 |\r\n| PROFILE-0177 |          5.000 |        2 |\r\n| PROFILE-0177 |          6.000 |       33 |\r\n+--------------+----------------+----------+\r\n5 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[12.527121, "o", "\r\n"]
[12.528372, "o", "PROFILE-0082 is well covered (241 units on hand). PROFILE-0177\r\n"]
[12.529596, "o", "is thin -- 35 units against 248 pending -- genuinely needs to\r\n"]
[12.530926, "o", "run.\r\n"]
[15.535139, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.536432, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[15.538032, "o", " Die availability before committing to the plan\r\n"]
[15.539268, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[15.540451, "o", "Before deciding what to extrude, check the dies behind\r\n"]
[15.54171, "o", "today's planned profiles -- how many kg each has left\r\n"]
[15.54289, "o", "before its next nitriding:\r\n"]
[17.545569, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    m.cod_perfil,\r\n    CONCAT(k.cod_matriz, '/', k.nro_serie_matriz) AS matriz,\r\n    k.nro_nitruraciones AS nro_nit,\r\n    ROUND(k.entdsdultnit__kg) AS kg_desde_ult_nit,\r\n    k.max__kg,\r\n    ROUND(k.kg_disponibles) AS kg_disponibles\r\nFROM matrices_kgdisponibles_v k\r\nJOIN matrices m ON m.codigo = k.cod_matriz\r\nWHERE m.cod_perfil IN ('PROFILE-0168', 'PROFILE-0075', 'PROFILE-0175', 'PROFILE-0187')\r\nORDER BY kg_disponibles\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[17.552343, "o", "+--------------+------------+---------+------------------+---------+----------------+\r\n| cod_perfil   | matriz     | nro_nit | kg_desde_ult_nit | max__kg | kg_disponibles |\r\n+--------------+------------+---------+------------------+---------+----------------+\r\n| PROFILE-0075 | DIE-0002/1 |       2 |              295 |    2000 |           1705 |\r\n| PROFILE-0075 | DIE-0002/2 |       2 |               84 |    2000 |           1916 |\r\n| PROFILE-0175 | DIE-0072/1 |       4 |              558 |    4000 |           3442 |\r\n| PROFILE-0168 | DIE-0069/1 |       3 |                0 |    4000 |           4000 |\r\n| PROFILE-0187 | DIE-0081/1 |       3 |                0 |    4000 |           4000 |\r\n+--------------+------------+---------+------------------+---------+----------------+\r\n5 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[20.556456, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.558073, "o", "All four dies have real headroom -- DIE-0002/1 (PROFILE-0075)\r\n"]
[20.559634, "o", "has the least at 1705 kg, still well clear. Nothing here\r\n"]
[20.561104, "o", "blocks the plan -- DIE-0072/1 shows real margin too, on its\r\n"]
[20.562592, "o", "4th nitriding cycle -- past nitruracion_kgmax's last defined\r\n"]
[20.564291, "o", "row, which now correctly carries that row's limit forward\r\n"]
[20.566276, "o", "instead of coming back empty.\r\n"]
[23.571351, "o", "\r\n"]
[23.572481, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[23.573555, "o", " First shift -- 50 billets max\r\n"]
[23.574744, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[23.57583, "o", "plan_extrusion_v already has the day sequenced by billet\r\n"]
[23.577104, "o", "count -- a running total against the shift's capacity shows\r\n"]
[23.578503, "o", "exactly where the cutoff falls:\r\n"]
[25.581304, "o", "--------------\r\nSELECT\r\n    fecha,\r\n    op,\r\n    subop,\r\n    cod_perfil,\r\n    cant_plan AS billets,\r\n    orden,\r\n    SUM(cant_plan) OVER (ORDER BY orden) AS running_total,\r\n    IF(SUM(cant_plan) OVER (ORDER BY orden) <= 50, 'yes', 'next shift') AS fits_first_shift\r\nFROM plan_extrusion_v\r\nWHERE fecha = '2019-08-26'\r\nORDER BY orden\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n"]
[25.584208, "o", "+------------+----+-------+--------------+---------+-------+---------------+------------------+\r\n| fecha      | op | subop | cod_perfil   | billets | orden | running_total | fits_first_shift |\r\n+------------+----+-------+--------------+---------+-------+---------------+------------------+\r\n| 2019-08-26 | 35 |     2 | PROFILE-0168 |      24 |     1 |            24 | yes              |\r\n| 2019-08-26 | 34 |     5 | PROFILE-0075 |       9 |     2 |            33 | yes              |\r\n| 2019-08-26 | 35 |     1 | PROFILE-0175 |       7 |     3 |            40 | yes              |\r\n| 2019-08-26 | 36 |     1 | PROFILE-0187 |      30 |     4 |            70 | next shift       |\r\n+------------+----+-------+--------------+---------+-------+---------------+------------------+\r\n4 rows in set\r\n\r\n"]
[28.588354, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.590111, "o", "The first three orders fit in 40 billets -- the fourth (30\r\n"]
[28.591656, "o", "more) would blow past the 50-billet cap, so it rolls to the\r\n"]
[28.593942, "o", "next shift instead of splitting an order mid-run. All three\r\n"]
[28.595359, "o", "dies behind them are clear to run, headroom already checked\r\n"]
[28.59685, "o", "above.\r\n"]
[31.600943, "o", "Bye\r\n"]
